  "structural_change": "S81-SLICE (stream 0cm, owner-approved DV p4): new control-plane sub-leaf (centre leaf, C1 master, 14 per die) of the distributed-vector slice; flop-first pins, die hold budget; pin-bound square outline (7.8k pins, <= 6/um on full faces). XR2 (10-17, after EARLY_FAIL_SETUP -611 ps / 9.3k endpoints of 1dd564c6f): classify stage (+1 cycle on CTL / RD / lo / V / SC) registers the source select, CTL payload, RD row pairs and decoded per-target / per-leaf enables before any wide write (was one cycle E/N pin flop -> 1.1k-bit select -> 5x1024 unpacker enables); keep port registers for c_d / is_d / cfg_d / rb_d (synthesis had folded 960 + 160 pins onto 160 + 32 flops driving W and N faces); fixed-index pk pair writes. OWNERS-S81/XR (10-18): ported onto RTL-BUILD-S81's xr (ENG collector e_*/eg_* -> xfin s, g_* gate fan-out, CTL target 1 x_mode/x_scale; +738 pins -> 8.6k) -- outline 432 x 518.4 (W face c/sw/e/g 2,850 pins on 505 um = 5.6/um, S + x_mode/x_scale/eg).",
